:: Arrival
{chapter "Evening"}
You shoulder the door shut on the storm. Water runs from your coat onto the flagstones of the Wayfarer's Rest, the only inn this side of the river.

[[Continue -> Taproom]]

:: Taproom [room: taproom]
Rain hammers the shutters of the Wayfarer's Rest. A fire smokes in the hearth, and the taproom smells of wet wool and ale.{if isHere(marta)} [[Marta]]{menu marta} works behind the bar.{/if}{if isHere(wren)} [[Wren]]{menu wren} stands dripping by the fire.{/if}

{if isHere(marta) && !talkingTo(marta)}[[Talk to Marta]]{act hello({ who: marta })}{/if}

{if isHere(wren) && !talkingTo(wren)}[[Talk to Wren]]{act hello({ who: wren })}{/if}

{topics}

{exits}

:: Kitchen [room: kitchen]
A low kitchen, hot as an oven. A pot of stew mutters on the range.{if isHere(tobias)} [[Tobias]]{menu tobias} stirs it, frowning.{/if}{if isHere(wren)} [[Wren]]{menu wren} has followed you in.{/if}

{if isHere(tobias) && !talkingTo(tobias)}[[Talk to Tobias]]{act hello({ who: tobias })}{/if}

{if isHere(wren) && !talkingTo(wren)}[[Talk to Wren]]{act hello({ who: wren })}{/if}

{topics}

{exits}

:: Cellar [room: cellar]
Barrels, and the drip of water somewhere in the dark.{if isHere(marta)} [[Marta]]{menu marta} wrestles a fresh barrel onto its stand.{/if}{if isHere(wren)} [[Wren]]{menu wren} waits on the bottom step.{/if}

{if isHere(marta) && !talkingTo(marta)}[[Talk to Marta]]{act hello({ who: marta })}{/if}

{if isHere(wren) && !talkingTo(wren)}[[Talk to Wren]]{act hello({ who: wren })}{/if}

{topics}

{exits}

:: Stable [room: stable]
Horses shift in the straw, and the wind howls through the gaps in the boards.{if isHere(tobias)} [[Tobias]]{menu tobias} forks hay into the mangers.{/if}{if isHere(wren)} [[Wren]]{menu wren} shelters by the door.{/if}

{if isHere(tobias) && !talkingTo(tobias)}[[Talk to Tobias]]{act hello({ who: tobias })}{/if}

{if isHere(wren) && !talkingTo(wren)}[[Talk to Wren]]{act hello({ who: wren })}{/if}

{topics}

{exits}

:: Landing [room: landing]
A narrow landing under the eaves. The roof leaks into a bucket.{if isHere(wren)} [[Wren]]{menu wren} paces by the window.{/if}

{if isHere(wren) && !talkingTo(wren)}[[Talk to Wren]]{act hello({ who: wren })}{/if}

{topics}

{exits}

:: Your Room [room: yourRoom]
A small room with a hard bed. It's {timeOfDay()}.{if isHere(wren)} [[Wren]]{menu wren} stands in the doorway.{/if}

{if isHere(wren) && !talkingTo(wren)}[[Talk to Wren]]{act hello({ who: wren })}{/if}

{topics}

{if night.promised}[[Sleep -> The Ferry]]{else}[[Sleep -> Morning]]{/if}

{exits}

:: Wren's Tale [cutscene]
{chapter "Wren's Tale"}
“I ride for the duchess,” Wren says, low. “Her letters, to the coast. There are people who'd pay well to read this one.”
{beat 1s}
“If the bridge is gone, I'm stuck here. But a ferry crosses at first light.”
{continue back}

:: The Ferry
{chapter "Morning"}
At first light the storm has blown itself out. You find the ferryman at the river and hand him Wren's letter. He tucks it into his coat without a word, and pushes off into the grey.
{if night.paid}Marta waves you off from the door.{else}Behind you, Marta shouts something about your bill.{/if}

THE END

:: Morning
{chapter "Morning"}
At first light the storm has blown itself out. Wren is gone, her room empty, and the ferry already halfway across the river.
{if night.paid}Marta waves you off from the door.{else}Behind you, Marta shouts something about your bill.{/if}

THE END
